gEDA-ai
-------

The current project overview, screenshot, Apple Silicon macOS build notes,
AI Assist instructions and regression checks are in README.md.

This development checkpoint works on Apple Silicon Macs only.
Maintainer: John Ryan, Aquana Press (Aqnana.net).
Support: https://github.com/tambotitree/geda-ai/issues

